%% Hopline — web/desktop session phases (apps/web/src/state/session-reducer.js).
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> idle

  idle --> starting: createRoom() / joinRoom(code)
  starting --> idle: server unreachable, room not found or full, too many wrong codes
  starting --> waiting: created (room code)
  starting --> connecting: joined

  waiting --> connecting: peer-joined (relay credentials arrive, host makes the offer)
  waiting --> idle: room expired / Hide-my-IP without a relay
  connecting --> connected: data channel open
  connecting --> ended: no route within 60 s

  connected --> reconnecting: channel closed / ICE failed
  reconnecting --> connected: new session's channel opens (transfers resume)
  reconnecting --> ended: not restored within 3 min / peer left

  connected --> ended: peer left
  ended --> idle: Start over (frees browser storage)
  waiting --> idle: Leave
  connecting --> idle: Leave
  connected --> idle: Leave
  reconnecting --> idle: Leave

  note right of connected
    A dropped signaling WebSocket alone doesn't
    interrupt anything: it rejoins in the background.
  end note
  note right of ended
    Received files stay available to save
    until the user starts over.
  end note
